<title>FRANCE: MATIF, MONEP trading to resume at 1355 GMT.</title>
<headline>MATIF, MONEP trading to resume at 1355 GMT.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading on the MONEP French options market and the open outcry trading in the MATIF futures market will resume at 1355 GMT on Tuesday after the earlier evacuation of the trading hall for a bomb alert, a spokesman for MATIF said.</p>
</text>
